        "original_id": "81fe07b0-b9da-5a20-8535-21299d2d10d3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Series: Rob\n- People: Rob Schneider, Cheech Marin, Claudia Bassols, Diana Maria Riva, Eugenio Derbez, Ricky Rico, Lupe Ontiveros\n- Organizations: CBS\n- Works: Rules of Engagement, Selena\n- Topics: American sitcom television\n\nFacts:\n- Rob is an American sitcom television series that premiered on CBS on January 12, 2012, at 8:30 pm ET as a mid-season replacement for Rules of Engagement.\n- Rob ended on March 1, 2012.\n- Rob was stylized in promos as ¡Rob!.\n- Rob stars Rob Schneider, Cheech Marin, Claudia Bassols, Diana Maria Riva, Eugenio Derbez, Ricky Rico, and Lupe Ontiveros.\n- Lupe Ontiveros was born as Guadalupe Moreno on September 17, 1942.\n- Lupe Ontiveros was an American actress best known for portraying Yolanda Saldívar in the film Selena.\n- Lupe Ontiveros died on July 26, 2012.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
